    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d364">

                <pb facs="0473" n="377" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg377"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-08-02"><hi rendition="#italic">August 2,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Haitian sought asylum in legation; was removed by force. Have demanded his
                    return, and apology from Government for invading same. Is to be returned. Please
                    advise me as to surrendering him to authorities. Matters here very critical.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
